    Code.ReferenceMatchSubject => "Stable code for a match whose scrutinee is a reference; match its referent with `match &subject.*`."
    Code.UnprovedRequirementPremise => "Stable code for a call that does not prove a `?S in R` requirement-row premise of its callee."
